  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The given curves are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>The point of intersection of the curves&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is obtained by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>.</p><p>Hence the points are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>The points of intersection of the curves&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;is obtained by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>Hence the points are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>The required graph is&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1559b7c7-dafd-416a-b28a-b9f5dd5efd48-9925356.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 354px;\" /></p><p>The required area is symmetrical about&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis.</p><p>Hence required area is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><msqrt><mi>y</mi></msqrt><mo>d</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>4</mn><mn>7</mn></msubsup><msqrt><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></msqrt><mo>d</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac></mfenced><mn>4</mn><mn>7</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math>&nbsp;sq units.</p><p>Hence, the required area is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math>&nbsp;sq units.</p></blockquote>",
